Subject: [PATCH] init: mount /run tmpfs with mode 0755

The kernel defaults a tmpfs root to 1777. The finish module moves this
mount to the installed root, and systemd skips its own mode=0755 mount
when /run is already mounted. Set the intended mode at creation so that
strict external authorized_keys ancestor checks can trust /run.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/init
+++ b/init
@@ -86,3 +86,3 @@
 mount -t sysfs sysfs /sys
-mount -t tmpfs tmpfs /run
+mount -t tmpfs -o mode=0755 tmpfs /run
 mkdir -p /run/lock
